<title>FRANCE: FIGURE SKATING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from men's qualifying in</p>
<p>the European figure skating championships which began at Bercy</p>
<p>on Sunday (top 15 from each of two groups qualify for main</p>
<p>event):</p>
